OL,3,GNEWSABird 'flockdown' impacting egg and
OL,4,Aturkey sales
OL,5,
OL,6,FBird owners have been told to stop
OL,7,Fselling eggs and other poultry products
OL,8,Ffollowing a National Housing Order by
OL,9,Fthe UK's Chief Veterinary Officer.
OL,11,FOwners of poultry and other
OL,12,Fdomesticated birds or those who sell
OL,13,Feggs, meat products or live birds must
OL,14,Fhouse their birds due to an outbreak of
OL,15,Faviation flu.
OL,17,FThe order came into force on 11
OL,18,FNovember, and applies to anyone who
OL,19,Fgives away or sells eggs or meat,
OL,20,Fincluding commercial farmers and
OL,21,Fhonesty boxes.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
