OL,3,GNEWSABird 'flockdown' impacting egg and
OL,4,Aturkey sales
OL,5,
OL,6,FPete Benn, who runs Bisley Birds in
OL,7,FStroud, Gloucestershire said it applies
OL,8,Fto anyone selling and giving away eggs:
OL,9,F"Even if you just give an egg to your
OL,10,Fneighbour, just over the wall, it's
OL,11,Fstill classed as given away."
